r524 (F138). Craig approved go-live 24 Oct 2026. Staging (`cdsmnqxtyyoeoznmbidd`) only. Production was not touched. No SQL was applied. #501, #498 and #493 are not merged.

Rebased onto current main `b62029b0` (r523 / F137, PERTH DELIVERY to Sublet), which sits on `f827e145` (r525 / F139, Website activity Last 24 hours). r523 and r525 are taken. r524 / F138 was still free, so this release keeps that pair. No new regression-check sort. Sort 307 is the r523 check.

## What was wrong

r518 (PR #500, merge `4d506905`) paints the Parts tile green as soon as a verified Navision JITA number is present. In `incomingWorkChecklistHtml` that return runs before `importedPartsStatus`, and Sales `pmb-stations.js` does the same. Orange, red, review and grey imported colours never reach the tile. A parts stoppage was already left as a stoppage.

Stock 13018393, job J139125903, location Other, JITA JSO121708. Read 24 Oct 2026: `pdc_imported_parts_flags_vehicle_20260912` and `pdc_parts_flags_vehicle_20260911` both return colour orange, vehicle label "Parts outstanding — see job cards", `parts_complete` false. The job row (backorder=1, backorder_with_po=0, parts_attached=1, source tune_pmg) says "Parts outstanding — check PO". The tile showed green with both ticks. The vehicle-level label is "see job cards". "Check PO" is the job-level label inside that payload.

## Count

`pdc_ops.r518_parts_jita_tick_audit` has 297 rows. All 297 are still live board vehicles. Client colour is `pdc_parts_flags_vehicle_20260911` (an active row in `pdc_parts_completion_email_confirmations` makes that read green).

- Orange, no email confirmation: 118. Every one is still the pristine r518 insert (parts row received, required, not ordered, no email date, not stoppage, `updated_by` null, and a completed PARTS work item whose notes are exactly `r518: Navision JITA number station tick`). Locations: IT 21, Other 32, PMB 35, YH 30. None of those locations are QC or RFT. This is the live count behind the reported ~119. The tile fix turns these 118 from a full green tick to orange with a corner tick.
- Grey, no email confirmation: 36. Label "Parts requirements need review". Also pristine r518 inserts. The tile fix shows grey with a corner tick. They are not outstanding, so the data option does not touch them. After this release, the tile says review-needed and `parts_received` stays true.
- Green, no email confirmation: 112. Full green tick stays. Screenshot vehicle: stock 12638294, job J139125441, location PMB, JITA JSO118332, label "All active jobs parts-ready".
- Green because of an active parts-complete email: 23. Raw import underneath: 19 green, 3 grey, 1 orange. The client colour is green, so the tile stays the full green tick. The data option does not undo them.
- No imported jobs (flags null): 8. Full green tick stays. Screenshot vehicle: stock 13001553, location PMB, JITA JSO115073.
- Review: 0. Red: 0. The tile code still keeps those colours and puts the JITA tick in the corner.

118 + 36 + 112 + 23 + 8 = 297.

